eic,eic:045959366a5dc2d3,full,unit_conversion_error,"if the speed of a man is 51 km per hour, then what is the distance traveled by him in 30 seconds?","First, we convert the speed from kilometers per hour to meters per second by multiplying by 1000/3000.
