eic,eic:052634c739e9770c,full,adding_irrelevant_information,"Joe needs to paint all the airplane hangars at the airport, so he buys 360 gallons of paint to do the job. During the first week, he uses 1/9 of all the paint. During the second week, he uses 1/5 of the remaining paint. How many gallons of paint has Joe used?","Joe used 360 / 9 = 40 gallons of paint in the first week.
