eic,eic:05662a83b36f44d1,full,referencing_context_value_error,"if the average (arithmetic mean) of 2a + 16, 3a - 8 is 94, what is the value of a?","The average of 2a + 16 and 3a - 8 is (2a + 16 + 3a - 8) / 2 = 5a + 8 / 2 = (5a + 8) / 2
