eic,eic:16a6a5881e1012e0,full,missing_step,Katie has 13 pink marbles. She has 9 fewer orange marbles than pink marbles. She has 4 times as many purple marbles as orange marbles. How many marbles does Katie have in all?,"Find the number of purple marbles. 13 marbles - 9 marbles x 4 = 16 marbles
