eic,eic:2030035b06a8f335,full,adding_irrelevant_information,A luxury bag costs $3000. A reseller wants to get a 15% profit. How much should she sell the bag?,"The reseller wants to get $3000 x 15/100 = $450 profit. Because she provides premium packaging which costs $50, the total cost increases to $3050.
