eic,eic:26da3f3c1bde997c,full,calculation_error,"After collecting all the old electronics in their house, Lauryn made $2000 from selling the items on eBay. If her friend Aurelia also made 70% of what she sold on eBay after selling her used electronics, calculate the total amount of money the two friends made on eBay.","If Lauryn made $2000 from eBay, then her friend made 70/100*$2000 =$1300
