eic,eic:298af7d2a12a782d,full,referencing_context_value_error,"Troy bakes 2 pans of brownies, cut into 16 pieces per pan. The guests eat all of 1 pan, and 75% of the 2nd pan. One tub of ice cream provides 8 scoops. If all but 4 of the guests eat the brownies ala mode (with 2 scoops of vanilla ice cream), how many tubs of ice cream did the guests eat?","Troy bakes 2 x 15 = 30 brownie pieces.
