eic,eic:33125e1a4b991141,full,referencing_previous_step_value_error,a and b start walking towards each other at 1 pm at speed of 5 kmph and 7 kmph. They were initially 24 km apart. At what time do they meet?,"Relative speed = 5 + 7 = 12 km/hr
