eic,eic:395b14b881d072e0,full,confusing_formula_error,"The ratio between the perimeter and the width of a rectangle is 5 : 1 . if the area of the rectangle is 150 sq . cm , what is the width of the rectangle ?","Let x be the width of the rectangle.
