eic,eic:397a93859475bbc7,full,unit_conversion_error,"A car traveling at a certain constant speed takes 5 seconds longer to travel 1 km than it would take to travel 1 km at 90 km / hour. At what speed, in km / hr, is the car traveling?","Let the speed of the car be x km/hr.
