eic,eic:3b2b8880111befbc,full,referencing_previous_step_value_error,"On a particular day, Rose's teacher read the register and realized there were twice as many girls as boys present on that day. The class has 250 students, and all the 140 girls were present. If all the absent students were boys, how many boys were absent that day?","If there were twice as many girls as boys present that day, then the number of boys is 140 girls / 2 girls/boy = 70 boys.
