eic,eic:3c505a2cec40ef1f,full,referencing_previous_step_value_error,A train is running at a speed of 40 km/hr and it crosses a post in 18 seconds. What is the length of the train?,"Speed = 40 km/hr = 40 x (5/18) m/s = (200/18) m/s = (100/9) m/s
