eic,eic:3c567a8348812f85,full,counting_error,"From Monday to Friday, Elle practices piano for 30 minutes. On Saturday, she practices piano three times as much as on a weekday. There is no practice on Sunday.  How many hours does Elle spend practicing piano each week?","From Monday to Friday, Elle practices 0.50 x 5 = 2.5 hours.
