eic,eic:3ddea96f8b8f3405,full,unit_conversion_error,Minnie is making a playlist of songs for a party she will be throwing. She wants the playlist to be an hour long. She has added 16 three-minute songs to the playlist. How many four-minute songs does she have to add to make sure the playlist is an hour long?,"An hour is equal to 50 minutes.
