eic,eic:3e0616c66d7742dd,full,counting_error,"the average temperature for monday, tuesday, wednesday and thursday was 48 degrees and for tuesday, wednesday, thursday and friday was 46 degrees. if the temperature on monday was 40 degrees. find the temperature on friday?","The total temperature from Monday to Thursday is 48 * 4 = 192 degrees
