eic,eic:3f05a39b9322308c,full,referencing_previous_step_value_error,How many portions of 200 ml milk can Jasmine pour from a full 2-liter container of milk?,"Since there are 1000 ml in 1 liter, then 2 liters is equal to 1000 x 2 = 2000 ml.
