eic,eic:4056eb752fd03c04,full,missing_step,"Shawn collected 40 plain pebbles. He painted 9 pebbles red and 13 pebbles blue. He then divided the remaining pebbles equally into 3 groups, and painted them purple, yellow, and green. What is the difference between the number of blue and yellow pebbles?","Shawn painted 40 - 9 = 31 pebbles as red and other colors.
