eic,eic:4317133b573d1ec9,full,calculation_error,"Because he’s taxed by his home planet, Mork pays a tax rate of 40% on his income, while Mindy pays a rate of only 30% on hers. If Mindy earned 3 times as much as Mork did, what was their combined tax rate?","Mindy earned 3 times as much as Mork, so Mindy's income was 3x and Mork's income was x.
