eic,eic:46be6c6fa3d4445e,full,missing_step,a 230 m long train running at the speed of 120 km / hr crosses another train running in opposite direction at the speed of 80 km / hr in 9 sec . what is the length of the other train ?,"The relative speed of the two trains = 33.33 + 22.22 = 55.55 m/s
