eic,eic:47583ba133dbe4a1,full,calculation_error,Jackie can do 5 push-ups in 10 seconds. How many push-ups can she do in one minute if she takes two 8-second breaks?,"There are 60 seconds per minute, so Jackie’s push-up routine takes 1 * 60 = 60 seconds.
