eic,eic:4759e263389aa8e8,full,operator_error,"Three times the sum of marbles that Atticus, Jensen, and Cruz have is equal to 60. If Atticus has half as many marbles as Jensen, and Atticus has 4 marbles, how many marbles does Cruz have?","Three times the sum of marbles that Atticus, Jensen, and Cruz have is equal to 60, meaning together they have 60*3=180 marbles.
