eic,eic:499998973ed9f242,full,adding_irrelevant_information,"There are 15 cats in a shelter. One-third were adopted, and were replaced with twice the amount that were adopted. Later on, twice as many dogs showed up as there are cats. How many total animals are there in the shelter?","15/3=5 cats were adopted out of 15
