eic,eic:4d285059c7c26170,full,counting_error,"If the 5th date of a month is Tuesday, what date will be 3 days after the 3rd Friday in the month?","The 3rd Friday in the month will be the date 15 (since the 1st date is Tuesday and the 5th date is also Tuesday)
