eic,eic:517ceb452cd029b4,full,operator_error,"60 litres of diesel is required to travel 600 km using a 800 cc engine. If the volume of diesel required to cover a distance varies directly as the capacity of the engine, then how many litres of diesel is required to travel 800 km using 1200 cc engine?","The diesel required per km is 60 / 600 = 0.1 litres/km
