eic,eic:5b910558ac492cb4,full,adding_irrelevant_information,"Derek has $960 to buy his books for the semester. He spends half of that on his textbooks, and he spends a quarter of what is left on his school supplies. What is the amount of money Derek has left?","Amount spent on textbooks is 960/2 = 480 dollars.
