eic,eic:663a83e40c005b65,full,adding_irrelevant_information,"Jacob has half the number of shoes Edward has. Edward has 3 times the number of shoes Brian has. If Brian has 22 pairs of shoes, how many pairs of shoes do they have in total?","Edward has 3 * 22 = 66 pairs of shoes.
