eic,eic:6645d44cc7de7e3b,full,calculation_error,Two trains 140 m and 200 m long run at the speed of 60 km / hr and 40 km / hr respectively in opposite directions on parallel tracks. The time which they take to cross each other is?,"Time taken to cross each other = (Sum of lengths of trains) / (Relative speed of the two trains) 
