eic,eic:667ac02277df4684,full,referencing_previous_step_value_error,a jogger running at 9 km / hr along side a railway track is 240 m ahead of the engine of a 120 m long train running at 27 km / hr in the same direction. in how much time will the train pass the jogger?,"Convert the speed of the train from km/hr to m/s: 27 km/hr * (1000 m / 1 km) * (1 hr / 3600 s) = 7.5 m/s
