eic,eic:677c3342368022db,full,confusing_formula_error,In digging a pond 20 m * 12 m * 5 m the volumes of the soil extracted will be ?,"The volume of the soil extracted from the pond is the volume of the rectangular cuboid, which is given by the formula V = l * w * h
