eic,eic:69f04e3fad7f7059,full,referencing_previous_step_value_error,"On the night of the dance, 400 students show up to the party. 70% of the students who showed up were invited. If 40% of those invited to the party had their invitation revoked and were not allowed into the party, how many invited students attended the party?","On the night of the dance 70/100*400 = 280 students who showed up to the party were invited.
