eic,eic:6a6bb6ed410d7c29,full,unit_conversion_error,two watches are set for an alarm at 10 0 ' clock in the night . one watch gains 2 minutes per hour . when the faster watch shows 4 : 12 in the morning when the alarm rings what does the correct watch show ?,"From 10:00 at night to 4:12 in the morning, there is a total of 6 hours and 12 minutes.
