eic,eic:6df4e66d9b0ca7d7,full,confusing_formula_error,John has 3 boxes. Each box is 5 inches by 6 inches by 4 inches. The walls are 1 inch thick. What is the total inner volume of all 3 boxes?,"The walls subtract 2*1=2 inches from each dimension
