eic,eic:6e65b5446143f137,full,counting_error,"Gary’s gas station serves an average of 13 cars per hour on Saturdays, 10 cars per hour on Sundays, and 9 cars per hour on all other days of the week. If the station is open from 6 a.m. to 10 p.m. every day, how many cars does Gary’s station serve over the course of a typical week?","The station is open for 16 hours on Saturday and Sunday, and 16 * 4 = 64 hours on all other days
