eic,eic:7019a270fa76d668,full,counting_error,"Sheila works 8 hours per day on Monday, Wednesday, and Friday, and 6 hours per day on Tuesday and Thursday. She does not work on Saturday and Sunday. She earns $360 per week. How much does she earn in dollars per hour?","She works 8 hours on Monday, Wednesday, and Friday, for a total of 8 * 2 = 16 hours
