eic,eic:719b44ba7f828c00,full,unit_conversion_error,"While driving from a-ville to b-town, harriet drove at a constant speed of 110 kilometers per hour. upon arriving in b-town, harriet immediately turned and drove back to a-ville at a constant speed of 140 kilometers per hour. if the entire trip took 5 hours, how many minutes did it take harriet to drive from a-ville to b-town?","Let the time taken to drive from a-ville to b-town be x hours.
