eic,eic:743a430a48cefd48,full,counting_error,"a lemonade stand sold only small and large cups of lemonade on tuesday . 4 / 5 of the cups sold were small and the rest were large . if the large cups were sold for 7 / 6 as much as the small cups , what fraction of tuesday ' s total revenue was from the sale of large cups ?","Let's assume the total number of cups sold is represented by x
