eic,eic:779b1afcf5bc3f77,full,operator_error,A marathon is 26 miles.  He can run the first 10 miles in 1 hour.  For the remaining miles he runs at 80% that pace.  How long does the race take?,"There are 26+10=36 miles left for the rest of the race
