eic,eic:878b0c5a5857d9b8,full,unit_conversion_error,"Carter has a 14-hour road trip. He wants to stop every 2 hours to stretch his legs. He also wants to make 2 additional stops for food and 3 additional stops for gas. If each pit stop takes 20 minutes, how many hours will his road trip become?","He has a 14-hour trip and wants to stop every 2 hours so that's 14/2 = 7 pit stops
