eic,eic:87ba42dd28aa99b5,full,operator_error,"Jimmy is at the candy store and buys 2 candy bars for $.75 each. He then buys 4 lollipops that cost $.25 each. He spent 1/6 of the money he earned from shoveling snow. If he charges $1.5 per driveway, how many driveways did he shovel?","Jimmy spent $1.5 on candy bars because 2 x .75 = 1.5
