eic,eic:883300ce5b8a02a7,full,referencing_previous_step_value_error,Dan spent an hour doing 400 work tasks at $0.25 each. Then Dan spent an hour doing 5 work tasks at $2.00 each. How much more did Dan make doing the good work compared to the lower-paid work?,"Dan spent an hour doing 400 tasks * $.25 = $100.
