eic,eic:890ff78aa850fc03,full,operator_error,Solomon bought a dining table at a 10% discount and paid the sale price of $450. What was the original price of the dining table?,"Since there was a 10% discount, this means that Solomon only paid 100% + 10% = 110% of the original price.
