eic,eic:8c3e144336461f2d,full,calculation_error,"the present ages of abi and suji are in the ratio of 5:4 respectively. 3 years hence, the ratio of their ages will become 11:9 respectively. what is suji's present age in years?","Let's assume the present age of abi and suji are 5x and 4x respectively.
