eic,eic:8d6065321ad8a867,full,referencing_context_value_error,"Nathan plays amateur baseball. He played for 3 hours for two weeks, every day. His friend Tobias played for 5 hours every day, but only for one week. How many hours did Nathan and Tobias play in total?","Two weeks are 10 days, so Nathan played for 3 * 10 = 30 hours.
