#### 115.5",Divides the total by the wrong number of data values,His average temperature is 99 degrees because 693 divided by 6 equals 115.5.,ok,ok,,10,False,False,False,,True,1,"{""original_solution"": ""The total temperature for the week is 693 because 99.1 plus 98.2 plus 98.7 plus 99.3 plus 99.8 plus 99 plus 98.9 equals 693.\nHis average temperature is 99 degrees because 693 divided by 7 equals 99.\n#### 99"", ""original_answer"": 99.0, ""transformed_answer"": 115.5, ""wrong_step"": 2, ""explanation"": ""Here, step 2 mistakenly counts Sunday, Monday, Tuesday, Wednesday, Thursday, Friday, and Saturday as 6 days instead of 7 days, resulting in <His average temperature is 99 degrees because 693 divided by 7 equals 99.> in the original_solution being changed to <His average temperature is 115.5 degrees because 693 divided by 6 equals 115.5.> in the transformed_solution. Only one counting error is present, which is changing the divisor from 7 to 6, while the division calculation process itself remains correct."", ""is_single_error"": true, ""type_dir"": ""counting_error"", ""source_benchmark"": ""GSM8K""}",,,,
eic,eic:8da6430902db095a,full,calculation_error,"You walk twice as fast as Mr. Harris, and Mr. Harris took 2 hours to walk to the store. If your destination is 3 times further away than the store Mr. Harris walked to, how many hours will it take you to get there?","First we find out how long it would take Mr. Harris to walk to your destination, which we find by multiplying his 2 hour walk by 3 since your destination is 3 times further away, meaning it would take him 2*3= 6 hours.
