eic,eic:8ff05598f3873988,full,operator_error,"Valerie earns $5000 per month, 1/2 of what her brother earns. If their mother earns twice their combined salary, what's the total amount of money they all have together?","Valerie's brother earns 2 / $5000 = $1000
