eic,eic:9111a91a727e71d6,full,counting_error,A library has an average of 510 visitors on Sunday and 240 on other days. The average number of visitors per day in a month of 30 days beginning with a Sunday is?,"The total number of visitors on Sunday in a month is 510 * 4 = 2040 visitors
