eic,eic:91e1fa55a09f9828,full,unit_conversion_error,"A leak in the bottom of a tank can empty the full tank in 6 hours. An inlet pipe fills water at the rate of 6 litres a minute. When the tank is full, the inlet is opened and due to the leak, the tank is empty in 12 hours. How many litres does the cistern hold?","Let x be the capacity of the tank in litres.
