eic,eic:931485114d3b5da4,full,unit_conversion_error,"A light flashes every 20 seconds, how many times will it flash in 1/4 of an hour?","There are 60 seconds in a minute and 50 minutes in an hour, so there are 60 x 50 = 3000 seconds in an hour.
