eic,eic:97073d44b1991b7c,full,calculation_error,"the distance from city a to city b is 220 miles. while driving from city a to city b, bob drives at a constant speed of 40 miles per hour. alice leaves city a 30 minutes after bob. what is the minimum constant speed in miles per hour that alice must exceed in order to arrive in city b before bob?","The time it takes Bob to get to city B is 220/40 = 5.5 hours
