eic,eic:985f284f099d0990,full,adding_irrelevant_information,5 geckos on the kitchen window eat 6 insects each. 3 lizards eat twice as much as the geckos.  How many total insects were eaten?,"The number of insects the geckos eat is 5 x 6 = 30.
