eic,eic:9f161c70d5dcb32c,full,calculation_error,"If 853845 bars of chocolate need to be placed in little boxes and each box can contain at most 9 bars of chocolate, how many bars of chocolate will be in the last unfilled box?","To find the number of bars in the last box, calculate 853845 modulo 9.
