eic,eic:a03504889a7ed1f7,full,operator_error,what is the value of ( 4 ) ^ - 5 ?,"The value of ( 4 ) ^ - 5 is 1 * (4^5).
This means 1 * (4 x 4 x 4 x 4 x 4).
