eic,eic:a151887eaa427065,full,counting_error,"Bethany loved riding horses. She rode 1 hour after school every Monday, Wednesday, and Friday. On Tuesday and Thursday, she rode for 30 min and on Saturdays, she could ride for 2 hours. How many hours in total did she ride over a 2 week period?","She rode 1 hour every Monday, Wednesday and Friday each week so every week she rode 1*3 = 3 hours
