eic,eic:a6033c04083e14c2,full,operator_error,"On Thursday, Joe caught 3 pounds of crawfish. He caught 4 times that amount on Friday and half the amount of his Friday's catch on Saturday. If 1 serving of crawfish is 3 pounds, how many servings does he have?","He caught 3 pounds on Thursday and caught 4 times the amount on Friday for a total of 3*4 = 12 pounds
