eic,eic:a667e8c03c5ecb65,full,counting_error,"Sheila works 8 hours per day on Monday, Wednesday, and Friday, and 6 hours per day on Tuesday and Thursday. She does not work on Saturday and Sunday. She earns $324 per week. How much does she earn in dollars per hour?","Sheila works (8 hours/day * 3 days) + (6 hours/day * 1 day) = 24 + 6 = 30 hours per week
