eic,eic:a6d87d1cc40fc674,full,referencing_context_value_error,A club wants to mix 20 pounds of candy worth $10.00 per pound with candy worth $5.00 per pound to reduce the cost of the mixture to $6.00 per pound. How many pounds of the $5.00 per pound candy should be used?,"Let x be the number of pounds of $5.00 per pound candy.
