eic,eic:a79e9d985a26a541,full,counting_error,"Zainab earns $2 an hour passing out flyers at the town square. She passes out flyers on Monday, Wednesday, and Saturday each week, for 4 hours at a time. After passing out flyers for 4 weeks, how much money will Zainab earn?","Every day Zainab passes out flyers, she earns $2 x 4 = $8
