eic,eic:a9fd9b2a8998fe1b,full,referencing_previous_step_value_error,"Alicia's clothes have to be sent to the dry cleaners weekly. Her weekly drop-off includes 5 blouses, 2 pants and 1 skirt. If they charge her $5.00 per blouse, $6.00 per skirt and $8.00 per pair of pants, how much does she spend on dry-cleaning in 5 weeks?","The blouses cost $5.00 each to dry clean and she has 5 so that's 5*5 = $25.00
The one skirt she has costs $6.00 to dry clean
The pants cost $8.00 to dry clean and she has 2 pairs so that's 8*2 = $16.00
