eic,eic:aa940792ac89936c,full,referencing_context_value_error,"David is taking a data analytics course that lasts for 24 weeks. The course consists of 2 three-hour classes and 1 four-hour class each week. In addition, David must spend 4 hours each week working on small group homework assignments. How many hours will he spend on this course?","Each week, David will spend 3 hours + 3 hours + 4 hours = 10 hours in class.
