eic,eic:b0237b8edd63b569,full,missing_step,"On Monday, Walt walked 4 miles. Tuesday, he walked 6 times as many miles as he walked on Monday. His total mileage Monday through Wednesday was 41 miles. How many miles did he walk on Wednesday?","Walt’s Monday and Tuesday walk were 4+4*6 = 52 miles combined.
