eic,eic:b0aa599b2890c4b0,full,calculation_error,"Martin went on an eight-hour business trip. During the first half of the trip, he traveled at a speed of 70 kilometers per hour and during the second half at a speed of 85 kilometers per hour. How many kilometers did he travel during the journey?","Half of the trip lasts for 8 * 0.5 = 4 hours.
