eic,eic:b0ba59c30d0cc286,full,confusing_formula_error,"if equation | x / 4 | + | y / 4 | = 2.5 encloses a certain region on the coordinate plane , what is the area of this region ?","The equation can be rewritten as | x | + | y | = 10
