eic,eic:b7129fadc789d1e1,full,referencing_context_value_error,Some of 50% - intensity red paint is replaced with 20% solution of red paint such that the new paint intensity is 40%. What fraction of the original paint was replaced?,"Let x be the fraction of the original paint that was replaced. 
