0.05x + 0.05 = 2.5 - 1.5
0.05x = 1 - 0.05
0.05x = 0.95
x = 0.95/0.05
x = 19
#### 19",Adds an unsupported extra loss to the final volume calculation,Assuming that the sugar solution is used to make a syrup and 1 liter of water is lost in the process,ok,ok,,10,False,False,False,,True,1,"{""original_solution"": ""Initial amount of sugar = 50 * 3/100 = 1.5 liters\nLet x be the amount of water evaporated.\nFinal amount of sugar = 50 - x liters\nUsing the formula (1.5)/(50-x) = 5/100\n1.5/(50-x) = 0.05\n1.5 = 0.05(50-x)\n1.5 = 2.5 - 0.05x\n0.05x = 2.5 - 1.5\n0.05x = 1\nx = 1/0.05\nx = 20\n#### 20"", ""original_answer"": 20.0, ""transformed_answer"": 19.0, ""wrong_step"": 3, ""explanation"": ""Step 3 adds information that is not mentioned in the question statement <Assuming that the sugar solution is used to make a syrup and 1 liter of water is lost in the process>, resulting in step 3 changing from 1.5/(50-x) = 0.05 in the original_solution to 1.5/(50-x-1) = 0.05 in the transformed_solution. This changes the final result of the equation, which affects the transformed_answer to be 19 instead of 20. It should be noted that you only need to consider one error of adding additional information in one step, and the other calculation processes should be correct."", ""is_single_error"": true, ""type_dir"": ""adding_irrelevant_information"", ""source_benchmark"": ""MathQA""}",,,,
eic,eic:b768790597f968cf,full,missing_step,"Of 70 players on a football team, 28 are throwers. The rest of the team is divided so one third are left-handed and the rest are right-handed. Assuming that all throwers are right-handed, how many right-handed players are there total?","The number of left-handed players is 70 / 3 = 23.33, rounded down to 23 since you can’t have a fraction of a player.
