eic,eic:b8c72d59441289de,full,operator_error,In what time will a railway train 30 m long moving at the rate of 36 kmph pass a telegraph post on its way?,"First convert the speed from km/h to m/s: 36 km/h * (1000 m/km) * (3600 s/h) = 129600 m/s
