eic,eic:b90fd9980effee37,full,referencing_previous_step_value_error,in one alloy there is 12 % chromium while in another alloy it is 8 %. 15 kg of the first alloy was melted together with 35 kg of the second one to form a third alloy. find the percentage of chromium in the new alloy.,"Total weight of the new alloy is 15 + 35 = 50 kg.
