eic,eic:b99acb77b6f3f1cc,full,adding_irrelevant_information,Scout delivers groceries on the weekends. His base pay is $10.00 an hour. He also earns a $5.00 tip per customer that he delivers groceries to. On Saturday he worked 4 hours and delivered groceries to 5 people. Sunday he worked 5 hours and delivered groceries to 8 people. How much did he make over the weekend?,"He worked 4 hours on Saturday and 5 hours on Sunday for a total of 4+5 = 9 hours
His base pay is $10.00 an hour and he worked 9 hours for a total of 10*9 = $90.00
