eic,eic:c58cc26836df524d,full,unit_conversion_error,"It takes Jennifer 20 minutes to groom each of her 2 long hair dachshunds. If she grooms her dogs every day, how many hours does she spend grooming her dogs in 30 days?","She has 2 dogs and it takes 20 minutes to groom just 1 dog so it takes her 2*20 = 40 minutes per day to groom 2 dogs
