eic,eic:ca8f4888060c381c,full,referencing_context_value_error,"A child is making a 5-level pyramid by stacking some blocks. In the first row, he has 9 blocks. For the next rows, he has 2 less than the blocks he has from its bottom row. How many blocks did he use in all?","On the second row, he used 8 - 2 = 6 blocks.
