x + 30 = 2x + 4
30 - 4 = 2x - x
25 = x
The present age of the son is 25
#### 25",Makes an arithmetic subtraction error when isolating the variable,"30 - 4 = 2x - x
25 = x",ok,ok,,9,False,False,False,,True,1,"{""original_solution"": ""Let the son's present age be x\nThe man's present age is x + 28\nIn two years, the son's age will be x + 2 and the man's age will be x + 28 + 2 = x + 30\nAccording to the given condition, x + 30 = 2(x + 2)\nx + 30 = 2x + 4\n30 - 4 = 2x - x\n26 = x\nThe present age of the son is 26\n#### 26"", ""original_answer"": 26.0, ""transformed_answer"": 25.0, ""wrong_step"": 6, ""explanation"": ""In this example, the calculation 30 - 4 has been incorrectly modified to result 25 instead of 26. This affects the final result, as the error in step 6 changes the subsequent result. Step 6 should correctly be 26 = x, following the steps established in the original solution. However, due to this single calculation error, the wrong answer derived is 25, which only affects the final outcome, without changing any previous or unrelated solution steps."", ""is_single_error"": true, ""type_dir"": ""calculation_error"", ""source_benchmark"": ""MathQA""}",,,,
eic,eic:cc4d45e7644acd80,full,calculation_error,"What is the perimeter, in meters, of a rectangular garden 8 meters wide that has the same area as a rectangular playground 16 meters long and 12 meters wide?","Area of the garden = 8 * length
