eic,eic:ce8fa15b72dba1b4,full,referencing_context_value_error,"During one day, there are 4 boat trips through the lake. The boat can take up to 12 people during one trip. How many people can the boat transport in 2 days?","During each boat trip, there can be 10 people onboard, so during 4 boat trips, there can be 4 * 10 = 40 people in total.
