eic,eic:ceaf77fe89c9223f,full,adding_irrelevant_information,"In an election, candidate A got 80% of the total valid votes. If 15% of the total votes were declared invalid and the total number of votes is 560000, find the number of valid votes polled in favor of candidate?","Number of invalid votes = 15% of 560000 = 0.15 * 560000 = 84000
