eic,eic:d6621e7d4465a2ab,full,calculation_error,"Yoque borrowed money from her sister. She promised to pay it back in 11 months including an additional 10% of the money she borrowed. If she pays $15 per month, how much money did she borrow?","In 11 months, Yoque will pay a total of $15 x 11 = $165.
