eic,eic:d6b191fd3de8a8bf,full,unit_conversion_error,"If an object travels 80 feet in 4 seconds, what is the object's approximate speed in miles per hour? (note: 1 mile = 5280 feet)","The speed is calculated as distance / time. So, the speed is 80 feet / 4 seconds = 20 feet per second.
