eic,eic:d75beb59c948d7e3,full,counting_error,"Ludwig works 7 days a week and he usually works half of the day during Friday, Saturday, and Sunday. If his daily salary is $10, how much does he earn every week?","Ludwig earns a total of $10 x 4 = $40 from Monday to Thursday.
