eic,eic:d79b4ebd1b18c7c9,full,referencing_context_value_error,A train 160 m long running at 72 kmph crosses a platform in 25 sec. What is the length of the platform?,"First, convert the speed from km/h to m/s: 70 km/h * (1000 m/km) * (1 h/3600 s) = 19.44 m/s
