eic,eic:da25f53e4b459ad5,full,calculation_error,In what time will a railway train 30 m long moving at the rate of 36 kmph pass a telegraph post on its way?,"First convert the speed from km/h to m/s: 36 km/h * (1000 m/km) / (3600 s/h) = 10 m/s
