eic,eic:db75d237a650042f,full,missing_step,"At the zoo, there are 5 different types of animals. Seeing each animal type takes around 6 minutes. How much time would it take to see each animal type if the zoo decided to import 4 new species?","Seeing each type of animal would take 5 * 6 = 30 minutes.
