eic,eic:e002c1b007f9edc4,full,referencing_previous_step_value_error,"James hurt himself exercising.  The pain subsided after 3 days, but he knew that the injury would take at least 5 times that long to fully heal. After that, he wanted to wait another 3 days before he started working out again.  If he wants to wait 3 weeks after that to start lifting heavy again, how long until he can lift heavy again?","The injury would be fully healed after 3*5=15 days
