eic,eic:e004362d28ff4f5e,full,referencing_context_value_error,"Ella earned $33 for 3 hours of dog walking. If she continues to walk dogs at the same rate, how much would she earn after 12 hours?","Ella earned $30 / 3 hours of dog walking = $10 per hour.
