eic,eic:e078ad0aa0d55896,full,referencing_previous_step_value_error,"Leo and Agrey went fishing. Agrey caught 20 more fish than Leo. If Leo caught 40 fish, what's the total number of fish they caught together?","Agrey caught 40+20 = 60 fish.
