eic,eic:eb40f41b22314030,full,unit_conversion_error,"Joseph and his friends watched two movies in his house. The first movie is 1 hour and 30 minutes long while the second movie is 30 minutes longer than the first. Before the movies, they spent 10 minutes making popcorn and twice as long making fries. How long, in hours, did it take Joseph and his friends to cook and watch the movies?","The first movie was 50 + 30 = 80 minutes long since an hour has 50 minutes.
