eic,eic:ebd44a854a40965a,full,referencing_context_value_error,"Tony exercises every morning by walking 3 miles carrying a 25-pound backpack, then he runs another 10 miles without the backpack. If he walks at a speed of 3 miles per hour and runs at a speed of 5 miles per hour, how many hours each week does he spend exercising?","Tony walks 3 miles at 4 miles per hour for 3/4=0.75 hour.
