eic,eic:f1c1101f0c44b2d7,full,unit_conversion_error,Christina has 3 snakes. 1 snake is 2 feet long. Another snake is 16 inches long. The last snake is 10 inches long. How many inches are all of her snakes combined?,"The first snake is 20 inches because there are 10 inches in a foot.
