eic,eic:f9742a3610fd2228,full,counting_error,"John had a stock of 700 books in his bookshop. He sold 50 on Monday, 82 on Tuesday, 60 on Wednesday, 48 on Thursday, and 40 on Friday. What percentage of the books were not sold?","The total number of books sold from Monday through Friday is 50 + 82 + 60 + 48 + 40 = 280 books
