eic,eic:faddecfdcb3d40b8,full,unit_conversion_error,"Naruto can lift a mountain ten times higher than Kagiyami can. But Kagiyami can lift a mountain 4 times higher than Saskay can. And Saskay can lift a mountain 12 times higher than Pompei can. If Pompei can lift a mountain 1 inch, how high can Naruto lift a mountain, in feet?","If Pompei can lift a mountain 1 inch, and Saskay can lift a mountain 12 times higher than Pompei can, then Saskay can lift a mountain 12*1=12 inches=1 yard.
