eic,eic:fb5714ad1ba503ca,full,adding_irrelevant_information,"A metallic sheet is of rectangular shape with dimensions 48 m x 36 m . from each of its corners , a square is cut off so as to make an open box . if the length of the square is 3 m , the volume of the box ( in m 3 ) is :","Length after cutting the squares from each corner and an additional notch for handles = 48 - 2*3 - 2*0.5 = 48 - 6 - 1 = 41 m
