#### 32",Subtracts an incorrect value from the total time,"With the new varnish, it will take 72-40=32 more minutes",ok,ok,,8,False,False,False,,True,1,"{""original_solution"": ""Usually, the varnish on all 6 paintings would be dry in 7*6=42 minutes\nWith the new varnish, all 6 paintings would be dry in 12*6=72 minutes\nWith the new varnish, it will take 72-42=30 more minutes\n#### 30"", ""original_answer"": 30.0, ""transformed_answer"": 32.0, ""wrong_step"": 3, ""explanation"": ""Step 3 mistakenly references 42 as 40 from step 1 and changes 72-42=30 more minutes to 72-40=32 more minutes. It should be noted that step 1 in the transformed_solution <Usually, the varnish on all 6 paintings would be dry in 7*6=42 minutes> should be the same as the step 1 in the original_solution <Usually, the varnish on all 6 paintings would be dry in 7*6=42 minutes> and calculates its result 42 correctly. You need to only consider one error of referencing, so the calculation of all steps is still correct."", ""is_single_error"": true, ""type_dir"": ""referencing_previous_step_value_error"", ""source_benchmark"": ""GSM8K""}",,,,
eic,eic:fdbd78a4a8bddd34,full,calculation_error,"In an examination, there were 2,000 candidates, out of which 900 candidates were girls and the rest were boys. If 32% of the boys and 32% of the girls passed, then the total percentage of failed candidates is?","Number of boys = 2000 - 900 = 1100
