eic,eic:fee902a1503f4324,full,calculation_error,"There are 8 students. 4 of them are men and 4 of them are women. If 4 students are selected from the 8 students, what is the probability that the number of men is equal to that of women?","The total number of ways to choose 4 students out of 8 is C(8,4) = 70
