mathclean,mathclean:10d057bbbc8dc93d,full,computing error,"A basketball player made the following number of free throws in 8 successive games: 6, 18, 15, 14, 19, 12, 19, and 15. Additionally, in the next 4 games, the player improved and made 20, 17, 22, and 16 free throws. What is the median number of successful free throws over all 12 games?","To find the median number of successful free throws over all 12 games, we need to follow these steps:

