|(a x a)| = 0 (since a x a is 0)
|(a x b)| = |a| |b| sin(45°) = 1(1) sin(45°) = 1
|(9|(a x b)|) = |9|(1) = 9
|(b x b)| = 0 (since b x b is 0)

Substituting these values back into the expression, we get:

Area = 3(0) + 1 + 9(1) + 3(0)
