\]",Uses the continuous maximum instead of evaluating the discrete monthly values,"Therefore, the maximum value of sin \frac{\theta}{2} \cdot (1 + \cos \theta)\u0007 is \(\frac{4\sqrt{3}}{9}\).",ok,ok,,11,False,False,False,maximum,False,1,"{""extent"": ""obvious error"", ""difficulty_file"": ""challenging"", ""subset"": ""check_type_answer""}",,,,
