mathclean,mathclean:9c819fbd6f507795,full,logic error,"In the diagram, $AOB$ is a sector of a circle with $\angle AOB=60^\circ.$ $OY$ is drawn perpendicular to $AB$ and intersects $AB$ at $X.$ If the radius of the circle is 12 units, and a point $Z$ is placed on $OY$ such that $OZ = 6$ units, what is the length of $XZ$? [asy]
