mathclean,mathclean:a2ee2f9b57c630c4,full,logic error,"Each point in the hexagonal lattice shown is one unit from its nearest neighbor. How many equilateral triangles, with side lengths of 1 unit or more, can be formed using the lattice points? [asy]size(75);
