mathclean,mathclean:bad60234177d4d9e,full,logic error,"In the figure below, the area of $\triangle ABC$ is 27. If point $C$ moves along the y-axis such that its y-coordinate $p$ changes by 3 units every month, starting from $p = 9$ in January, what will be the area of $\triangle ABC$ in June?

[asy]
