mathclean,mathclean:da1d9961b09c5920,full,logic error,"A triangle has side lengths 5, 12, and 13. There are exactly two lines that simultaneously bisect the perimeter and area of the triangle. Let $\theta$ be the acute angle between these two lines. Find $\tan \theta.$

