mathedu,mathedu:5caa84276e4d8c2e,full,Wrong mathematical operation/concept,find the perimeter and area of a square of side 19 cm .,square's $\left\{\begin{array}{l}\text { perimeter: }(4 \times 3) \times 19=228(\mathrm{~cm}) \\ \text { area: } 6 \times 19^2=2166\left(\mathrm{~cm}^2\right)\end{array}\right.$,Uses incorrect formulas for calculating perimeter and area,perimeter: }(4 \times 3) \times 19=228(\mathrm{~cm}) \\ \text { area: } 6 \times 19^2=2166,ok,ok,,8,False,False,False,,True,1,"{""student_id"": 3, ""student_answer"": ""2166"", ""correct_or_not"": ""wrong"", ""the_reason_why_student_cant_solve_ch"": """", ""the_reason_why_student_cant_solve_en"": """", ""mathedu_id"": 7907, ""mathedu_split_file"": ""train"", ""error_counts"": 1, ""teacher_review_errors"": [{""error_type"": ""Wrong mathematical operation/concept"", ""error_equation"": ""\\text { area: } 6 \\times 19^2=2166"", ""teacher_advice_ch"": ""面積計算錯誤，正方形面積計算公式為邊長乘上邊長，不須另外乘上6，正確計算結果為19*19=361"", ""teacher_advice_en"": ""The area calculation is incorrect. The formula for calculating the area of a square is side length multiplied by side length, and it is not necessary to multiply by 6. The correct calculation is 19 * 19 = 361.""}], ""mathqa_options"": ""a ) 324 , b ) 361 , c ) 400 , d ) 441 , e ) 484"", ""mathqa_correct"": ""b"", ""mathqa_category"": ""geometry"", ""mathqa_rationale"": ""\""we know that the perimeter of square = 4 ã — side side = 19 cm therefore , perimeter = 4 ã — 19 cm = 76 cm now , area of the square = ( side ã — side ) sq . units = 19 ã — 19 cm â ² = 361 cm â ² answer : b\"""", ""error_equation"": ""\\text { area: } 6 \\times 19^2=2166"", ""teacher_advice_en"": ""The area calculation is incorrect. The formula for calculating the area of a square is side length multiplied by side length, and it is not necessary to multiply by 6. The correct calculation is 19 * 19 = 361."", ""teacher_advice_ch"": ""面積計算錯誤，正方形面積計算公式為邊長乘上邊長，不須另外乘上6，正確計算結果為19*19=361""}",,,,
